  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/send/hook_tmux.rs (tmux_nudge_message, run_tmux_send_keys, run_tmux_send_enter — zero call sites) is fully dead code. It was previously documented as fixed (removed or marked with #[expect(dead_code)]) at commit fa5ca78e on feature/pAG-s10-secured-transport. At the current commit 88eb5bcf on the same branch, the module re-appears with an explicit #[expect(dead_code, reason = '...')] attribute in send/mod.rs:38-42, indicating an intentional deferral of cleanup. This is classified as a REGRESSION: dead code that was previously eliminated has been reintroduced in a later commit on the same branch. AG10-REFACTOR-QA-1 (arch-qa ARCH-004, req-qa ATM-QA-AG10-003) independently confirmed the dead-code finding at 88eb5bcf." ;
